000400*================================================================
000500* RIBORDX  MONTHLY REINSURANCE BORDEREAUX       PRMMONTH STEP090
000600*
000700* BUILDS THE MONTH'S PREMIUM AND CLAIMS BORDEREAUX FOR EVERY
000800* OUTWARD TREATY ON THE 2026 PANEL, ONE BLOCK PER PRODUCT LINE.
000900* INPUTS:  CORV.PRM.BILLING.DAILY  ALL GENERATIONS (BILLREC)
001000*          CORV.CLMMAST            CLAIM MASTER (CLMREC)
001100*          CORV.POLMAST            POLICY MASTER (POLREC)
001200*          CESSTAB                 EFFECTIVE SHARES FROM RINSCALC
001300*                                  (PRMMONTH STEP080, PL/I)
001400* OUTPUT:  CORV.RI.BORDX.MONTHLY(+1)  FB LRECL 160
001500*          RECORD TYPE 'P' = PREMIUM CEDED, 'C' = CLAIM CEDED,
001600*          'M' = MEMO (LINE RETAINED OR RISK NOT CEDED),
001700*          'T' = CONTROL TOTAL PER TREATY.
001800* THE FILE GOES TO THE REINSURANCE BROKER BY THE FINANCE
001900* TRANSFER JOB; FINANCE RECONCILES IT TO LEDGER EACH QUARTER.
002000*
002100* TREATY PANEL 2026 (TERMS FROM THE SIGNED SLIPS, CHG-91020):
002200*  MTR MOTOR                  CMT-XL-26  XL 9,000,000 XS 1,000,000
002300*  HOM HOME BUILDINGS         CHB-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 20%
002400*  CNT HOME CONTENTS          CHB-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 20%
002500*  TRV TRAVEL                 CTR-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 60%
002600*  PET PET                    RETAINED, NO TREATY
002700*  LLD LANDLORD               CLL-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 25%
002800*  MAR MARINE CARGO           CMC-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 40%
002900*  CPR COMMERCIAL PROPERTY    CCP-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 30%
003000*  PLB PUBLIC LIABILITY       CPL-XL-26  XL 10,000,000 XS 750,000
003100*  PIN PROFESSIONAL INDEMNITY CPI-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 45%
003200*  CYB CYBER                  CCY-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 50%
003300*  GDG GADGET                 CGD-QS-26  QUOTA SHARE 70%
003400*
003500* PERSONAL DATA: NO NAME, ADDRESS, NI NUMBER OR INJURY DETAIL IS
003600* WRITTEN TO THE BORDEREAU. POLICY AND CLAIM NUMBERS ONLY.
