036400*================================================================
036500* MTR MOTOR: TREATY CMT-XL-26
036600*   RISK XL: 9,000,000 XS 1,000,000.
036700*   RETENTION 1,000,000 EACH AND EVERY LOSS.
036800*   REINSTATEMENTS: UNLIMITED, BROKERAGE 7.5% OF THE RATE-ON-LINE.
036900*   MINIMUM AND DEPOSIT PREMIUM IS BILLED BY THE BROKER; THE
037000*   PREMIUM BORDEREAU IS FOR THE ADJUSTMENT ONLY.
037100*   CURRENCY: GBP.  CASH-CALL THRESHOLD: 500,000.
037200*   PANEL:
037300*     HALVERN RE (LEAD) 60%
037400*     OSTMARK RUCK 40%
037500*   PPO: PERIODIC PAYMENT ORDERS ARE INDEXED BY ASHE 6115; THE
037600*          GROSS IS DEFLATED BY THE INDEX BEFORE THE RETENTION
037700*            IS TESTED.
037800*   FLEET: FLEET POLICIES (RISK DETAIL BYTE 41 = 'F') ARE
037900*     OUTSIDE THE
038000*          TREATY AND ARE FACULTATIVE; THEY ARE LISTED BUT NOT
038100*            CEDED.
038200*   UNINS: UNINSURED-DRIVER RECOVERIES FROM THE MIB REDUCE THE
038300*     GROSS
038400*          LOSS BEFORE THE XL LAYER IS APPLIED.
038500*   SEVER: A SINGLE CLAIM OVER 2,000,000 IS FLAGGED FOR THE LEAD
038600*          REINSURER'S CLAIMS CONTROL CLAUSE (NOTICE WITHIN 30
038700*            DAYS).
038800*================================================================
038900 MTR-TREATY.
039000     MOVE 'MTR'              TO TR-LINE-CODE(TX)
039100     MOVE 'CMT-XL-26 '       TO TR-TREATY-ID(TX)
039200     MOVE 'XL  '             TO TR-TYPE(TX)
039300     MOVE 0                   TO TR-SHARE-PCT(TX)
039400     MOVE 1000000             TO TR-RETENTION(TX)
039500     MOVE 9000000             TO TR-LIMIT(TX)
039600     MOVE 0                   TO TR-CEDING-COMM-PCT(TX)
039700     MOVE 7.5                 TO TR-BROKERAGE-PCT(TX)
039800     MOVE 0                   TO TR-PROFIT-COMM-PCT(TX)
039900     MOVE 500000              TO TR-CASH-CALL(TX)
040000     MOVE 0                   TO TR-EVENT-HOURS(TX)
040100     MOVE 99                  TO TR-REINSTATEMENTS(TX)
040200     MOVE ZERO TO TR-PREM-CEDED(TX) TR-CLAIMS-CEDED(TX)
040300                  TR-COMM-TOTAL(TX) TR-PREM-COUNT(TX)
040400                  TR-CLAIM-COUNT(TX) TR-MEMO-COUNT(TX).
040500 MTR-PREMIUM.
040600     SET TX TO 1
040700     MOVE PREMIUM-AMT TO WS-GROSS
040800     MOVE 'Y' TO WS-CEDE-SW
040900     MOVE SPACES TO WS-REASON
041000     PERFORM MTR-CHECKS
041100     PERFORM MTR-VALIDATE
041200*    XL PREMIUM IS A RATE ON GROSS NET PREMIUM INCOME (GNPI);
041300*    THE MONTH'S GNPI IS REPORTED, THE RATE IS APPLIED BY THE
041400*    BROKER AT ADJUSTMENT. ONLY BROKERAGE IS WORKED OUT HERE.
041500     IF WS-CEDE
041600         MOVE ZERO TO WS-PCT WS-CEDED WS-CEDING-COMM
041700         COMPUTE WS-BROKERAGE ROUNDED =
041800             WS-GROSS * TR-BROKERAGE-PCT(TX) / 100 / 100
041900         COMPUTE WS-NET-DUE = ZERO - WS-BROKERAGE
042000         PERFORM 6100-WRITE-PREMIUM
042100     ELSE
042200         PERFORM 6300-WRITE-MEMO
042300     END-IF.
042400 MTR-CLAIM.
